			"start": 3.52,
			"end": 6.37,
			"en": "Tickets, please.",
			"zh": "请出示车票。"
		},
		{
			"i": 2,
			"start": 6.52,
			"end": 12.32,
			"en": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
			"zh": "听录音，然后回答问题。"
		},
		{
			"i": 3,
			"start": 12.47,
			"end": 19.24,
			"en": "Why did George and Ken miss the train?",
			"zh": "乔治和肯为什么误了火车？"
		},
		{
			"i": 4,
			"start": 19.39,
			"end": 23.29,
			"en": "Two return tickets to London, please.",
			"zh": "请给我两张到伦敦的往返票。"
		},
		{
			"i": 5,
			"start": 23.44,
			"end": 27.07,
			"en": "What time will the next train leave?",
			"zh": "下一班火车什么时候开？"
		},
		{
			"i": 6,
			"start": 27.22,
			"end": 31.37,
			"en": "At nineteen minutes past eight.",
			"zh": "八点十九分。"
		},
		{
			"i": 7,
			"start": 31.52,
			"end": 33.25,
			"en": "Which platform?",
			"zh": "哪个站台？"
		},
		{
			"i": 8,
			"start": 33.4,
			"end": 35.03,
			"en": "Platform Two.",
			"zh": "二号站台。"
		},
		{
			"i": 9,
			"start": 35.18,
			"end": 38.08,
			"en": "Over the bridge.",
			"zh": "从天桥过去。"
		},
		{
			"i": 10,
			"start": 38.23,
			"end": 42.01,
			"en": "What time will the next train leave?",
			"zh": "下一班火车什么时候开？"
		},
		{
			"i": 11,
			"start": 42.16,
			"end": 44.8,
			"en": "At eight nineteen.",
			"zh": "八点十九分。"
		},
		{
			"i": 12,
			"start": 44.95,
			"end": 48.41,
			"en": "We've got plenty of time.",
			"zh": "我们时间很充裕。"
		},
		{
			"i": 13,
			"start": 48.56,
			"end": 52.38,
			"en": "It's only three minutes to eight.",
			"zh": "现在才差三分钟八点。"
		},
		{
			"i": 14,
			"start": 52.53,
			"end": 55.38,
			"en": "Let's go and have a drink.",
			"zh": "我们去喝一杯吧。"
		},
		{
			"i": 15,
			"start": 55.53,
			"end": 60.54,
			"en": "There's a bar next door to the station.",
			"zh": "车站旁边有个酒吧。"
		},
		{
			"i": 16,
			"start": 60.69,
			"end": 65.65,
			"en": "We had better go back to the station now, Ken.",
			"zh": "肯，我们现在最好回车站了。"
		},
		{
			"i": 17,
			"start": 65.8,
			"end": 68.08,
			"en": "Tickets, please.",
			"zh": "请出示车票。"
		},
		{
			"i": 18,
			"start": 68.23,
			"end": 72.76,
			"en": "We want to catch the eight nineteen to London.",
			"zh": "我们想乘八点十九分去伦敦的火车。"
		},
		{
			"i": 19,
			"start": 72.91,
			"end": 75.55,
			"en": "You've just missed it!",
			"zh": "你们刚错过了！"
		},
		{
			"i": 20,
			"start": 75.7,
			"end": 76.87,
			"en": "What!",
			"zh": "什么！"
		},
		{
			"i": 21,
			"start": 77.02,
			"end": 80.04,
			"en": "It's only eight fifteen.",
			"zh": "现在才八点十五分。"
		},
		{
			"i": 22,
			"start": 80.19,
			"end": 82.09,
			"en": "I'm sorry, sir.",
			"zh": "对不起，先生。"
		},
		{
			"i": 23,
			"start": 82.24,
			"end": 86.01,
			"en": "That clock's ten minutes slow.",
			"zh": "那个钟慢了十分钟。"
		},
		{
			"i": 24,
			"start": 86.16,
			"end": 88.62,
			"en": "When's the next train?",
			"zh": "下一班火车什么时候开？"
		},
		{
			"i": 25,
			"start": 88.77,
			"end": 92.77,
			"en": "In five hours' time!",
			"zh": "五个小时以后！"
		}
